  <h1 id="top">Rohit Sonika</h1>
  <p class="lede">Finance researcher and data strategist</p>

  <p>
    I work as the Saara and Björn Wahlroos Foundation Fellow at
    <strong>Hanken School of Economics</strong> in Helsinki, Finland.
    I study topics in corporate finance — how corporate and legislative 
    governance dictate executive decision-making.
  </p>

