  <h2 id="research">Research Interests</h2>
  <ul class="interest-list">
    <li>
      <strong>Payout Policy</strong>
      <span>Buybacks, dividends, and what firms signal through capital returns</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Executive Compensation</strong>
      <span>Option grants, FAS 123R, rent extraction vs optimal contracting</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Insider Trading</strong>
      <span>CEO networks, information asymmetry, and market timing</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Board Governance</strong>
      <span>Independence, related-party transactions, monitoring quality</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

